ary format. The bytes are grouped into chunks of 3 (24 bits total). Each 24-bit chunk is split into four 6-bit segments. Each 6-bit segment (a value from 0–63) is mapped to a corresponding character in the Base64 alphabet. If the final chunk has fewer than 3 bytes, the output is padded with one or two = ch

