      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Which tool should I run first when editing a draft?",
      "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Readability first, since sentence-level clarity is easiest to fix early. Keyword density and topical-coverage tools work best as a final pass once the structure and wording are settled, so the numbers reflect the finished draft rather than one you're about to rewrite." }
